<note>
<title>1/22 若林</title>
<content><![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?><!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd"><en-note><div>疲労度7~8</div><div><br/></div><div>・エロンゲーション</div><div>Level9</div><div>2′×2set</div></en-note>]]></content>
